    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "An unmanaged `scorecard.yml` runs the OpenSSF Scorecard action on every push to `main`, weekly, and on any branch-protection change, uploads its SARIF to code scanning and publishes the result to the OpenSSF API. Every action is pinned to a commit SHA. It is a report, not a gate: no pull request waits on it and `ci-gate` does not need it.\n",
